                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Morally unclean; obscene or indecent, especially sexually."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "577e37c1-a7cc-4db9-80c2-3cfee768d621",
                                                "sense_id": "bf5348df-0c8e-3d58-82d5-8ba204ff0ac4",
                                                "text": "At the reception, Uncle Nick got drunk and told dirty jokes to the bridesmaids."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a983913-0bb4-4c7e-863d-de5a3c4f4e36",
                                                "sense_id": "bf5348df-0c8e-3d58-82d5-8ba204ff0ac4",
                                                "text": "We have quite a playful and fun relationship in general, but it’s still surprising how dirty our sex can be in the things we say or do or pretend. We often laugh about it afterwards."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c05fa53-11da-384a-987f-270a03b5344f",
                                        "entry_id": "f6524f0b-e1a1-3622-8fa2-c949b9fbaff0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dishonorable; violating accepted standards or rules."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb98b5db-1490-4fe6-b977-5f75136377ff",
                                                "sense_id": "5c05fa53-11da-384a-987f-270a03b5344f",
                                                "text": "He might have scored, but it was a dirty trick that won him the penalty."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f2b7914-bcd7-4dcf-9b92-75ce41b566f8",
                                                "sense_id": "5c05fa53-11da-384a-987f-270a03b5344f",
                                                "text": "The world 'as got me snouted jist a treat; Crool Forchin's dirty left 'as smote me soul."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c48cd87f-687b-4f85-9f68-f9f86497d101",
                                                "sense_id": "5c05fa53-11da-384a-987f-270a03b5344f",
                                                "text": "The dirty secret of the internet is that all this distraction and interruption is immensely profitable.[…]Partly, this is a result of how online advertising has traditionally worked: advertisers pay for clicks, and a click is a click, however it's obtained."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a0ea0d4-6766-3b17-a315-bcc3f86f39b0",
                                        "entry_id": "f6524f0b-e1a1-3622-8fa2-c949b9fbaff0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Corrupt, illegal, or improper."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "820e2100-7c68-4c5b-884a-e4474b2677b4",
